    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nA privilege escalation vulnerability allows a non-admin moderator to bypass email-change restrictions, allowing a takeover of non-staff accounts.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nEnsure moderators are trusted. Or enable the \"require_change_email_confirmation\" setting.\r\n\r\n",
